{
  "tutorial": {
    "id": 4334,
    "version": 1,
    "type": "course",
    "isNew": false,
    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Zuweisung mit Operatoren",
    "descriptionContent": "Lerne, wie man die Operatoren +=, -=, ++ und -- verwendet.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17312,
        "title": "Zuweisungsoperatoren",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146656,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Da Selbstzuweisung ein mächtiges Werkzeug zum Erstellen von Spielen ist, lass uns ein paar Operatoren kennenlernen, die uns helfen, Code schneller zu schreiben.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146657,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir wissen, dass wir <code>1</code> zu einer Variable hinzufügen können, indem wir den Namen der Variable ausschreiben. In diesem Fall <code>score</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score = score + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>score</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146658,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Statt den Namen der Variable neu zu schreiben, können wir den <code>+=</code>-Operator verwenden, um eine Zahl mit <code>score += 1</code> zu addieren.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>score</code>, gefolgt von <code>+=</code> und schließlich <code>1</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146659,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um den Wert einer Variable zu verringern, verwenden wir den <code>-=</code> Operator, wie hier, wo wir <code>health</code> um <code>3</code> verringern.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"health -= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(health);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>-=</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146660,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der <strong>Inkrementoperator</strong>, <code>++</code>, der nach dem Namen einer Variable platziert wird, erhöht ihren Wert um <code>1</code>. Hier wird <code>coins++</code> den Wert von <code>5</code> auf <code>6</code> erhöhen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"coins++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>coins</code>, gefolgt von <code>+</code> und schließlich <code>+</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146661,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können <code>1</code> vom Wert einer Variable mit dem <strong>Dekrementoperator</strong> ( <code>--</code> ) subtrahieren, genau wie hier mit <code>lives--</code> .</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"lives++\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lives = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lives--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lives);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>lives--</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146662,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arrows = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"arrows += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arrows);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>8</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>8</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146663,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welchen Operator verwenden wir, um eine Zahl vom Wert einer Variable zu subtrahieren?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>-=</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146664,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Operator addiert eins zum Wert einer Variablen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>++</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>--</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>++</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerSpeed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerSpeed--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerSpeed);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>199</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>199</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Addiere zehn zum Wert der Variable mit dem <code>+=</code> Operator.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" xp = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"xp += \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(xp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>xp</code>, gefolgt von <code>+</code> und schließlich <code>=</code>, <code>10</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ziehe 200 vom Wert der Variable ab, indem du den <code>-=</code> Operator verwendest.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mana = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mana -= \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(mana);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>-=</code>, gefolgt von <code>200</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erhöhe den Wert der <code>ammo</code>-Variable um eins.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ammo + 2\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ammo++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ammo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>ammo</code>, gefolgt von <code>+</code> und schließlich <code>+</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146669,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verwende den Dekrement-Operator <code>--</code>, um die Munition um eins zu verringern.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"21\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ammo--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ammo);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>ammo--</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}